d\n   daigaku PERFECT HALO! 0.01 +5 s LATE +3 SMOOTH! @17:32:17\n   koen PERFECT HALO! -0.01 +5 s LATE +3 SMOOTH! @17:34:56","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2971b458-25be-4a87-89a5-fd55d735f2d2","uuid":"c3ad6ecc-32bf-48cc-9ee8-7b9edef81274","timestamp":"2026-11-04T12:45:09.286Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"par 06:39:44 s0 v0 cap999 B5 | 06:39:54 s0 v0 cap999 B2 | 06:40:04 s19 v21 cap999 P5 | 06:40:14 s118 v47 cap999 P2 | 06:40:24 s246 v44 cap999 N | 06:40:34 s366 v43 cap999 N | 06:40:44 s484 v42 cap999 N | 06:40:54 s611 v54 cap999 P4 | 06:41:04 s779 v64 cap999 P2 | 06:41:14 s962 v66 cap999 N | 06:41:24 s1144 v65 cap999 N | 06:41:34 s1320 v59 cap999 B3 | 06:41:44 s1462 v43 cap999 B3 | 06:41:54 s1555 v23 cap999 B3 | 06:42:04 s1595 v5 cap999 B3 | 06:42:14 s1600 v0 cap999 N | 06:42:24 s1600 v0 cap999 B2 | 06:42:34 s1600 v0 cap999 B2 | 06:42:44 s1600 v0 cap999 B2 | 06:42:54 s1600 v0 cap999 B2 | \ntimetable 06:39:44 s0 v0 cap999 B5 | 06:39:54 s0 v0 cap999 B2 | 06:40:04 s19 v21 cap45 P5 | 06:40:14 s111 v41 cap45 P2 | 06:40:24 s231 v43 cap44 N | 06:40:34 s351 v43 cap45 N | 06:40:44 s468 v42 cap44 N | 06:40:54 s584 v41 cap44 N | 06:41:04 s698 v41 cap44 N | 06:41:14 s811 v40 cap44 P2 | 06:41:24 s928 v43 cap44 N | 06:41:34 s1045 v42 cap43 N | 06:41:44 s1161 v41 cap42 N | 06:41:54 s1275 v41 cap42 N | 06:42:04 s1387 v40 cap40 N | 06:42:14 s1495 v36 cap35 B2 | 06:42:24 s1571 v19 cap20 B4 | 06:42:34 s1598 v3 cap20 B1 | 06:42:44 s1600 v0 cap120 B2 | 06:42:54 s1600 v0 cap120 B2 | \nS1: done rank A score 6890/8275 grace 46 comfort 98 calls 16/16 missed 0 t=346s events pa1,tipCall,pa2,kota,onc1,hornFish,pa3\n   hanabatake PERFECT HALO! -0.03 +5 s LATE +2 SMOOTH! @06:42:41\n   kujira GREAT! -0.14 +3 s LATE +3 SMOOTH! @06:45:26\nS3: done rank A score 7665/9325 grace 37.5 comfort 98 calls 17/17 missed 0 t=500s events fest,workers,wkLine,pa2,fuji,obst,onc3,pa3\n   yuhi PERFECT HALO! -0.03 +5 s LATE +18 SMOOTH! @14:04:17\n     HAZARD AVOIDED @14:06:47 s=11475\n